<title>AUSTRALIA: Normandy 9 month net profit A$83.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Normandy 9 month net profit A$83.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Australian gold mining group Normandy Mining Ltd said on Wednesday that it achieved a nine-month net profit of A$83.4 million.</p>
<p>The company also said net profit in the latest three months to March 31 was A$31.8 million.</p>
</text>
